{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1221520-werewolf-the-apocalypse-coming-to-storyteller-s-vault-in-june-2018","id":1221520,"title":"Werewolf the Apocalypse coming to Storyteller's Vault in June 2018","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-23T12:21:38-07:00","id":1221520,"title":"Werewolf the Apocalypse coming to Storyteller's Vault in June 2018","content":"Well, time to get the ball rolling on community content on everyone's favorite Rage-filled furballs.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> White Wolf Entertainment and DriveThruRPG Announce Werewolf: The Apocalypse coming to the Storytellers Vault in June 2018!<br /> <br /> Stockholm, Sweden \u2013 May 23, 2018<br /> <br /> White Wolf Entertainment announced today that the popular World of Darkness Werewolf: The Apocalypse setting will be joining Vampire: The Masquerade on the Storytellers Vault for community created content. Since its inception in the summer of 2017, aspiring writers, artists, and game designers have published over two hundred non-canonical table top RPG supplements, Mind\u2019s Eye Theatre larp supplements and fiction stories worldwide for Vampire: The Masquerade in the language of their choosing, and making half of the revenue as their royalty. As with Vampire: The Masquerade before it, White Wolf will assist content creators in making the best Werewolf possible products by offering a considerable variety of graphical layout tools including pre-made design templates, and art-packs to choose from. Additionally, in an effort to speed up the availability process for game lines to become available for content creation, all the Werewolf specific historical settings (Dark Ages &amp; Wild West) and Minds Eye Theatre will be made available during the first month of release.<br /> <br /> Werewolf: The Apocalypse for the Storytellers Vault features:<br /> <br /> \u2022 Self-publish service for table top RPG, Mind\u2019s Eye Theatre larp material &amp; fiction set using any Werewolf: The Apocalypse edition.<br /> \u2022 Content creators themselves set the price for the material they publish and receive 50% of the revenue<br /> \u2022 Access to templates and art packs produced helps content creators make their work look as professional as the official products from any set era including Werewolf: The Wild West and Dark Ages.<br /> \u2022 Publishing in any language supporting the vast global World of Darkness community<br /> \u2022 Additional content supporting other game lines and brands in the White Wolf catalogue will be progressively unlocked throughout the remainder of 2018. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-23T13:02:04-07:00","id":1221529,"title":"","content":"yaaaaaaaaaaaaay","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T05:41:13-07:00","id":1221666,"title":"","con